    "name": "Vestiges: Fallen Tribes",
    "steam_appid": 2511780,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511780/extras/51831f8dd2e2edaeeaf47eef7b07a334.poster.avif?t=1751897232\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511780/extras/51831f8dd2e2edaeeaf47eef7b07a334.webm?t=1751897232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511780/extras/51831f8dd2e2edaeeaf47eef7b07a334.mp4?t=1751897232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Vestiges: Fallen Tribes</strong></i> is a unique blend of strategy, board game mechanics, and autobattler gameplay. Immerse yourself in a sci-fi world where tribes are battling for water, and your tactical decisions will shape the future. As a tribe leader, you\u2019ll use a deck of cards to summon and command animated units round after round, until you come out on top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Playable Tribes:</strong> Each with unique abilities and playstyles, ranging from aggressive rush strategies to careful, defensive play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Campaign:</strong> Immerse yourself in a narrative-driven campaign with dozens of missions, each offering a set of tactical challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP Mode:</strong> Take on other players in competitive battles using your custom deck. Challenge friends or online opponents to prove your skills in real-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Strategy Gameplay:</strong> Deploy units directly onto the battlefield by using energy to play cards from your hand, and place them strategically. Then watch your cards come to life as animated warriors who fight for your cause.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(VR) Immersion:</strong> Experience the tribal science-fiction world of <i>Vestiges: Fallen Tribes</i> with fully immersive VR controls. Feel the weight of your decisions as you direct your forces from a god-like perspective.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Mode:</strong> Want to test out different strategies? The sandbox mode lets you experiment with your custom deck and battle setups without limits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re using your best strategy to complete every objective of the solo campaign, or battling other players in PvP, <i><strong>Vestiges: Fallen Tribes</strong></i> offers endless hours of immersive, tactical gameplay that will keep you coming back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>By the creators of awarded games Ragnarock and Propagation: Paradise Hotel.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511780/extras/51831f8dd2e2edaeeaf47eef7b07a334.poster.avif?t=1751897232\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511780/extras/51831f8dd2e2edaeeaf47eef7b07a334.webm?t=1751897232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511780/extras/51831f8dd2e2edaeeaf47eef7b07a334.mp4?t=1751897232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Vestiges: Fallen Tribes</strong></i> is a unique blend of strategy, board game mechanics, and autobattler gameplay. Immerse yourself in a sci-fi world where tribes are battling for water, and your tactical decisions will shape the future. As a tribe leader, you\u2019ll use a deck of cards to summon and command animated units round after round, until you come out on top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Playable Tribes:</strong> Each with unique abilities and playstyles, ranging from aggressive rush strategies to careful, defensive play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Campaign:</strong> Immerse yourself in a narrative-driven campaign with dozens of missions, each offering a set of tactical challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP Mode:</strong> Take on other players in competitive battles using your custom deck. Challenge friends or online opponents to prove your skills in real-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Strategy Gameplay:</strong> Deploy units directly onto the battlefield by using energy to play cards from your hand, and place them strategically. Then watch your cards come to life as animated warriors who fight for your cause.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(VR) Immersion:</strong> Experience the tribal science-fiction world of <i>Vestiges: Fallen Tribes</i> with fully immersive VR controls. Feel the weight of your decisions as you direct your forces from a god-like perspective.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Mode:</strong> Want to test out different strategies? The sandbox mode lets you experiment with your custom deck and battle setups without limits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re using your best strategy to complete every objective of the solo campaign, or battling other players in PvP, <i><strong>Vestiges: Fallen Tribes</strong></i> offers endless hours of immersive, tactical gameplay that will keep you coming back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>By the creators of awarded games Ragnarock and Propagation: Paradise Hotel.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Dive into a gripping strategy adventure set in a dystopian world. Lead your tribe to victory, deploy animated units, and conquer tactical challenges in this immersive (PC &amp; PCVR) turn by turn board game.",
